.TH COMPACTOR 1 "2026-09-23" "compactor" "Roll up S3 event objects into day/week/month JSONL, preserving client-side encryption."
.SH NAME
compactor - Roll up S3 event objects into day/week/month JSONL, preserving client-side encryption\&.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcompactor\fP [\fIoptions\&.\&.\&.\fP] [\fIargument\&.\&.\&.\fP]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB--config=PATH\fP
Path to YAML config file (default: XDG config dir)\&.
.TP
\fB--encryption-age-identity-file=STRING\fP
Path to age identity file (required for decrypt/materialize)\&.
.TP
\fB--encryption-age-recipients=ENCRYPTION-AGE-RECIPIENTS,\&.\&.\&.\fP
age1\&.\&.\&. recipient public keys\&.
.TP
\fB--encryption-scheme="none"\fP
Rollup output scheme\&.
.TP
\fB-h, --help\fP
Show context-sensitive help\&.
.TP
\fB--listen-debounce=5s\fP
Coalesce a burst of notifications for one day into a single reconcile\&.
.TP
\fB--listen-http-addr=":8080"\fP
Address to serve /healthz and /readyz on\&.
.TP
\fB--listen-nats-consumer="compactor"\fP
Durable JetStream consumer name\&.
.TP
\fB--listen-nats-stream="minio-events"\fP
JetStream stream MinIO's NATS notification target publishes to\&.
.TP
\fB--listen-nats-subject="minio\&.events\&.>"\fP
Filter subject within the stream\&.
.TP
\fB--listen-nats-url="nats://127\&.0\&.0\&.1:4222"\fP
NATS server URL\&.
.TP
\fB--logging-format="text"\fP
Log format\&.
.TP
\fB--logging-level="info"\fP
Log level\&.
.TP
\fB--materialize-cache-ttl=1h\fP
Materialized scratch file TTL, for the expiry sweep\&.
.TP
\fB--paths-checkpoint-prefix="checkpoints"\fP
Checkpoint key prefix\&.
.TP
\fB--paths-rollup-prefix="rollups"\fP
Rollup key prefix\&.
.TP
\fB--paths-source-prefix=STRING\fP
Base prefix under which year/month/day raw events live\&.
.TP
\fB--rollup-straggler-days=1\fP
Also re-check N prior days on every hourly run\&.
.TP
\fB--rollup-week-start="monday"\fP
Reserved; ISO 8601 (Monday-start) weeks are used today\&.
.TP
\fB--s3-bucket=STRING\fP
Bucket name\&.
.TP
\fB--s3-endpoint=STRING\fP
S3 endpoint (empty = AWS default; set for MinIO, e\&.g\&. http://localhost:9000)\&.
.TP
\fB--s3-region="us-east-1"\fP
AWS region\&.
.TP
\fB--s3-use-path-style\fP
Use path-style S3 addressing (most MinIO deployments)\&.
.TP
\fB--version\fP
Print version and exit\&.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBcheckpoint <command> [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Inspect or reset checkpoint state\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBCOMMANDS\fP
.RS 4
\fBcheckpoint reset [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Clear a checkpoint's tracking state (operator escape hatch)\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB--confirm\fP
Required to actually perform the reset\&.
.TP
\fB--day=STRING\fP
Day checkpoint to target (YYYY-MM-DD)\&.
.TP
\fB--month=STRING\fP
Month checkpoint to target (YYYY-MM)\&.
.TP
\fB--week=STRING\fP
Week checkpoint to target (YYYY-Www)\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBcheckpoint show [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Print a checkpoint's current state as JSON\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB--day=STRING\fP
Day checkpoint to target (YYYY-MM-DD)\&.
.TP
\fB--month=STRING\fP
Month checkpoint to target (YYYY-MM)\&.
.TP
\fB--week=STRING\fP
Week checkpoint to target (YYYY-Www)\&.
.RE
.RE
.TP
\fBcompletions <command> [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Generate a shell completion script\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBCOMMANDS\fP
.RS 4
\fBcompletions bash [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Generate a bash completion script\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB-o, --output=STRING\fP
Write to this file instead of stdout\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBcompletions fish [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Generate a fish completion script\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB-o, --output=STRING\fP
Write to this file instead of stdout\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBcompletions zsh [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Generate a zsh completion script\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB-o, --output=STRING\fP
Write to this file instead of stdout\&.
.RE
.RE
.TP
\fBlisten [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Run as a long-lived event-driven daemon (NATS-triggered rollups, health probes)\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBman [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Generate the man page\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB-o, --output=STRING\fP
Write to this file instead of stdout\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBmaterialize <key> [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Decrypt a rollup object into a local scratch file for DuckDB\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB--keep\fP
Skip sweeping expired scratch files from a previous run before materializing\&.
.TP
\fB--out=STRING\fP
Scratch directory to write the decrypted file into (default: XDG cache dir)\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBrollup <command> [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Roll up source events into day/week/month JSONL\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBCOMMANDS\fP
.RS 4
\fBrollup hourly [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Incremental day rollup (current day + configured stragglers)\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB--day=STRING\fP
Day to process (YYYY-MM-DD); default: today plus configured straggler days\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBrollup promote-month [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Rebuild a month rollup from its week rollups\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB--month=STRING\fP
Month to promote (YYYY-MM); default: current month\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBrollup promote-week [flags]\fP
.RS 4
Rebuild a week rollup from its day rollups\&.
.RE
.TP
\fBOPTIONS\fP
.RS 4
\fB--week=STRING\fP
ISO week to promote (YYYY-Www); default: current ISO week\&.
.RE
.RE
